<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Velani</p><h1 class="t1 rise">What we make.</h1><p class="lede fade">NEVORA, our own software for businesses that run on shifts and orders, and custom software we build for other businesses.</p></div></section><section class="hpanel " id="nevora" aria-labelledby="nevora-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-devices.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" fetchpriority="high"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">NEVORA Workforce&nbsp;· Available now</p><h2 class="rise" id="nevora-t"><img src="{{ 'night-nevora-wm-white.png' | asset_url }}" alt="NEVORA" width="907" height="122"></h2><p class="fade">Scheduling, time clock and payroll calculation for teams that work in shifts, with Rondo, its AI assistant, in development. Free for 30 days, for teams of up to 30 employees.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb fill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=nevora-demo{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora-demo{% endif %}">Request free trial<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a><a class="hb" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora{% endif %}">Learn more<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="hshot fade"><img src="{{ 'night-phone-long.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="NEVORA on an employee’s phone: her shift today and two things to do" width="1170" height="3936"></div></section><section class="hpanel right" id="relay" aria-labelledby="relay-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-store-soft.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">NEVORA Relay</p><h2 class="rise" id="relay-t">Every&nbsp;order. Every&nbsp;item. In&nbsp;sync.</h2><p class="fade">Orders, the kitchen screen and inventory in one system. Works on its own, and with NEVORA Workforce.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb fill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=relay{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=relay{% endif %}">Join the waitlist<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div><p class="hfact fade">In design&nbsp;· No dates yet</p></div><ul class="rcard" aria-label="What NEVORA Relay will do"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M72,104a8,8,0,0,1,8-8h96a8,8,0,0,1,0,16H80A8,8,0,0,1,72,104Zm8,40h96a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H80a8,8,0,0,0,0,16ZM232,56V208a8,8,0,0,1-11.58,7.15L192,200.94l-28.42,14.21a8,8,0,0,1-7.16,0L128,200.94,99.58,215.15a8,8,0,0,1-7.16,0L64,200.94,35.58,215.15A8,8,0,0,1,24,208V56A16,16,0,0,1,40,40H216A16,16,0,0,1,232,56Zm-16,0H40V195.06l20.42-10.22a8,8,0,0,1,7.16,0L96,199.06l28.42-14.22a8,8,0,0,1,7.16,0L160,199.06l28.42-14.22a8,8,0,0,1,7.16,0L216,195.06Z"/></svg><span><b>Orders</b>Entered at the counter, sent straight to the right preparation screen.</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M208,40H48A24,24,0,0,0,24,64V176a24,24,0,0,0,24,24H208a24,24,0,0,0,24-24V64A24,24,0,0,0,208,40Zm8,136a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H48a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V64a8,8,0,0,1,8-8H208a8,8,0,0,1,8,8Zm-48,48a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H96a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h64A8,8,0,0,1,168,224Z"/></svg><span><b>Kitchen display</b>Accept, prepare and complete orders. No paper tickets.</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M223.68,66.15,135.68,18a15.88,15.88,0,0,0-15.36,0l-88,48.17a16,16,0,0,0-8.32,14v95.64a16,16,0,0,0,8.32,14l88,48.17a15.88,15.88,0,0,0,15.36,0l88-48.17a16,16,0,0,0,8.32-14V80.18A16,16,0,0,0,223.68,66.15ZM128,32l80.34,44-29.77,16.3-80.35-44ZM128,120,47.66,76l33.9-18.56,80.34,44ZM40,90l80,43.78v85.79L40,175.82Zm176,85.78h0l-80,43.79V133.82l32-17.51V152a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V107.55L216,90v85.77Z"/></svg><span><b>Inventory</b>Stock updates as orders are completed, with a warning before you run low.</span></li><li class="rcard-more"><span>Pickup and delivery handoffs and a live dashboard will follow.</span></li></ul></section><section class="hpanel laptop" id="websites" aria-labelledby="websites-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-laptop.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">Custom development</p><h2 class="rise" id="websites-t">Websites</h2><p class="fade">Modern, fast and built to bring in calls and bookings on every phone.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/custom-development#web-applications{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-custom-development#web-applications{% endif %}">Explore websites<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="curren